<title>JAPAN: Nissin Food shares bid-only on share buy-backs.</title>
<headline>Nissin Food shares bid-only on share buy-backs.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nissin Food Products Co Ltd were bid-only on Tuesday morning, buoyed by news on Monday that the firm was planning to buy back up to six million of its own common shares at a cost not to exceed 15 billion yen.</p>
<p>The shares of the major instant noodle maker were quoted bid-only at 2,720 yen as of 0100 GMT, above Monday's closing of 2,640.</p>
</text>
